			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with latest Cocoon artifacts\n\nUpdate Element submodule from c181cb1f to b9df80b1, bringing in the latest Cocoon submodule sync from cbaf44f1 to 6ac5b208.\n\nThis routine sync pulls in the newest extension host implementation changes from Cocoon, which interfaces with Mountain via gRPC to run VS Code extensions through the Effect-TS service layer.",
