			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with latest Output artifacts\n\nUpdate Element submodule from 5691989 to c181cb1f, bringing in the latest Output submodule sync. The Output submodule contains compiled JavaScript bundles from the Rest bundler that are consumed by Cocoon at runtime.\n\nThis routine sync pulls in the newest bundled artifacts from the Rest element.",
			"SHA": "8af1d9f5ab547ab5574357b87e437b2d7b3d1dd3"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-24T23:39:39Z",
